# base.packages — the general engine and pandoc-template closure
#
# Installed in the Docker `base` stage. `README.md` in the directory above owns
# the row format.
#
# `ec` has no direct consumer here: it carries ectt1000.tfm, which soul.sty
# loads at package load. Pandoc pulls soul in for `.mark`/`.underline` under
# XeLaTeX, and with no mf in the image there is no mktextfm fallback.

amsfonts    AMS math symbol fonts
amsmath
bidi
bookmark
booktabs
caption
ec          EC font metrics, required by soul
fancyvrb
float
fontspec
footnotehyper
framed
geometry
graphics
hyperref
iftex
latex
microtype
multirow
parskip
setspace
soul
tools
ulem
unicode-math
upquote
xcolor
xetex
xurl
